   5:Core/Src/device/at24c02.c ****  *          APP mode: protected by xI2CMutex, uses vTaskDelay.
   6:Core/Src/device/at24c02.c ****  *          BOOT mode (#define BOOTLOADER_BUILD): no RTOS, uses HAL_Delay.
